{{define "contractor.gohtml"}}
  {{template "header.gohtml" .Header}}

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="section" style="background: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.55), rgba(0,0,0,0.55)), url('https://storage.googleapis.com/columbiaoutdoor-images/deck2.jpg') center/cover no-repeat; padding: 5rem 1.5rem;">
    <div class="container has-text-centered">
      <h2 class="title is-1 has-text-white">Stop Working for Free.</h2>
      <p class="subtitle has-text-white mt-4" style="max-width:700px; margin:1.5rem auto;">
        The average contractor spends 20+ hours on every outdoor living project before breaking ground —
        chasing leads, estimating, pulling permits, ordering materials.
        Columbia Outdoor handles it all. <strong class="has-text-warning">You build. We do the rest.</strong>
      </p>
      <a href="/contractor/register" class="button is-warning is-large is-rounded mt-4">
        <strong>Apply to Join the Network</strong>
      </a>
      <p class="has-text-white-ter mt-3 is-size-7">Licensed contractors in WA, OR, and ID welcome.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The Problem -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:780px;">
      <h3 class="title is-3 has-text-centered">The Problem with Outdoor Living Projects</h3>
      <p class="is-size-5 mt-4">
        Every deck, patio cover, pergola, and hardscape project starts the same way — weeks of unpaid work before you earn a dollar.
        You market, you call, you meet, you estimate, you price, you chase, you wait.
        Most of that time you're not billing anyone.
      </p>
      <p class="is-size-5 mt-4">
        Columbia Outdoor is built to change that for Pacific Northwest contractors.
        We handle everything that happens before the first nail — so your time is spent building, not planning.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The Homeowner Problem -->
  <section class="section has-background-light">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:780px;">
      <h3 class="title is-3 has-text-centered">The Homeowner Problem</h3>
      <p class="is-size-5 mt-4">
        Homeowners want a beautiful outdoor space — but they often don't know exactly what they want until they see what they can't have.
        Material options, design choices, structural requirements, permit restrictions — these decisions happen <em>during</em> the job
        when you're trying to build, not before. That's where scope creep starts, disputes happen, and contractors don't get paid.
      </p>
      <p class="is-size-5 mt-4">
        Columbia Outdoor solves this before the first nail. Every project starts with a
        <strong>detailed estimate and a structured contract</strong> that specifies exactly what is — and isn't — included.
        Homeowners know what they're getting. Contractors know what they're building.
        Anything beyond scope goes through a formal <strong>change order</strong> — no surprises, no disputes.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What We Handle -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:780px;">
      <h3 class="title is-3 has-text-centered">What Columbia Outdoor Handles</h3>
      <p class="has-text-centered mb-5 has-text-grey">So you can focus on what you do best.</p>

      <div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:1rem;">

        <div class="box" style="border-left: 4px solid #f5a623;">
          <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:1rem;">
            <span class="icon is-large has-text-warning"><i class="fas fa-user-check fa-lg"></i></span>
            <div>
              <p class="has-text-weight-bold is-size-5">Lead Generation &amp; Homeowner Matching
                <span class="tag is-success is-light ml-2">Available Now</span>
              </p>
              <p>Homeowners come to you — matched by service area and project type. No cold calls, no marketing spend.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="box" style="border-left: 4px solid #f5a623;">
          <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:1rem;">
            <span class="icon is-large has-text-warning"><i class="fas fa-calculator fa-lg"></i></span>
            <div>
              <p class="has-text-weight-bold is-size-5">Detailed, Branded Estimates
                <span class="tag is-success is-light ml-2">Available Now</span>
              </p>
              <p>Professional line-by-line estimates for decks, patio covers, pergolas, and hardscaping — with your logo, your contact info, your pricing.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="box" style="border-left: 4px solid #f5a623;">
          <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:1rem;">
            <span class="icon is-large has-text-warning"><i class="fas fa-tag fa-lg"></i></span>
            <div>
              <p class="has-text-weight-bold is-size-5">Pricing Guidance
                <span class="tag is-success is-light ml-2">Available Now</span>
              </p>
              <p>Know what to charge before you bid. Built-in material and labor cost frameworks for the Pacific Northwest market.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="box" style="border-left: 4px solid #ccc;">
          <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:1rem;">
            <span class="icon is-large has-text-grey"><i class="fas fa-file-contract fa-lg"></i></span>
            <div>
              <p class="has-text-weight-bold is-size-5">Structured Contracts
                <span class="tag is-warning is-light ml-2">Coming Soon</span>
              </p>
              <p>Clear scope of work, no ambiguities. Homeowners sign before work starts — eliminating disputes about what was agreed.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="box" style="border-left: 4px solid #ccc;">
          <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:1rem;">
            <span class="icon is-large has-text-grey"><i class="fas fa-exchange-alt fa-lg"></i></span>
            <div>
              <p class="has-text-weight-bold is-size-5">Change Orders
                <span class="tag is-warning is-light ml-2">Coming Soon</span>
              </p>
              <p>Anything outside the original scope goes through a formal change order — documented, priced, and approved before work continues.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="box" style="border-left: 4px solid #ccc;">
          <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:1rem;">
            <span class="icon is-large has-text-grey"><i class="fas fa-credit-card fa-lg"></i></span>
            <div>
              <p class="has-text-weight-bold is-size-5">Invoicing &amp; Payment Processing
                <span class="tag is-warning is-light ml-2">Coming Soon</span>
              </p>
              <p>Milestone-based payments released automatically. No chasing invoices, no withheld finals.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="box" style="border-left: 4px solid #ccc;">
          <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:1rem;">
            <span class="icon is-large has-text-grey"><i class="fas fa-drafting-compass fa-lg"></i></span>
            <div>
              <p class="has-text-weight-bold is-size-5">Professional Design &amp; Engineering
                <span class="tag is-warning is-light ml-2">Coming Soon</span>
              </p>
              <p>Stamped plans, structural engineering, and design drawings ready before you arrive on site.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="box" style="border-left: 4px solid #ccc;">
          <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:1rem;">
            <span class="icon is-large has-text-grey"><i class="fas fa-boxes fa-lg"></i></span>
            <div>
              <p class="has-text-weight-bold is-size-5">Material List Generator
                <span class="tag is-warning is-light ml-2">Coming Soon</span>
              </p>
              <p>Complete, job-ready material orders generated from the estimate. Every board, bolt, and beam — ready to order.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="box" style="border-left: 4px solid #ccc;">
          <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:1rem;">
            <span class="icon is-large has-text-grey"><i class="fas fa-file-alt fa-lg"></i></span>
            <div>
              <p class="has-text-weight-bold is-size-5">Permits
                <span class="tag is-warning is-light ml-2">Coming Soon</span>
              </p>
              <p>Permit applications submitted and tracked on your behalf. No more waiting in line at the permit office.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="box" style="border-left: 4px solid #ccc;">
          <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:1rem;">
            <span class="icon is-large has-text-grey"><i class="fas fa-calendar-alt fa-lg"></i></span>
            <div>
              <p class="has-text-weight-bold is-size-5">Scheduling
                <span class="tag is-warning is-light ml-2">Coming Soon</span>
              </p>
              <p>Jobs coordinated and scheduled through your project manager. You show up when it's ready to build.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Projects We Support -->
  <section class="section has-background-warning-light">
    <div class="container has-text-centered" style="max-width:680px;">
      <h3 class="title is-3">Outdoor Living Projects</h3>
      <p class="is-size-5 mt-3">
        Columbia Outdoor supports the full range of Pacific Northwest outdoor living work —
        and we're adding new project types regularly.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-4" style="display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; justify-content:center; gap:0.75rem;">
        <span class="tag is-warning is-medium"><i class="fas fa-check mr-1"></i> Decks</span>
        <span class="tag is-light is-medium">Patio Covers <em class="is-size-7 ml-1">— coming soon</em></span>
        <span class="tag is-light is-medium">Pergolas <em class="is-size-7 ml-1">— coming soon</em></span>
        <span class="tag is-light is-medium">Hardscaping <em class="is-size-7 ml-1">— coming soon</em></span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How It Works -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:680px;">
      <h3 class="title is-3 has-text-centered mb-5">How It Works</h3>

      <div class="media mb-5">
        <div class="media-left">
          <span class="tag is-warning is-large is-rounded"><strong>1</strong></span>
        </div>
        <div class="media-content">
          <p class="is-size-5"><strong>Apply &amp; get verified.</strong></p>
          <p>Submit your license, bond, and insurance. We verify your credentials — typically within 1–2 business days. No cost to apply.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="media mb-5">
        <div class="media-left">
          <span class="tag is-warning is-large is-rounded"><strong>2</strong></span>
        </div>
        <div class="media-content">
          <p class="is-size-5"><strong>Use the tools.</strong></p>
          <p>Generate professional estimates, set your service area, and connect with homeowners in your region who are ready to build.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="media mb-5">
        <div class="media-left">
          <span class="tag is-warning is-large is-rounded"><strong>3</strong></span>
        </div>
        <div class="media-content">
          <p class="is-size-5"><strong>Build and get paid.</strong></p>
          <p>Accept jobs with clear scope and structured contracts. No scope creep, no chasing payments, no surprises.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Final CTA -->
  <section class="section" style="background: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.6), rgba(0,0,0,0.6)), url('https://storage.googleapis.com/columbiaoutdoor-images/deck1.jpeg') center/cover no-repeat; padding: 4rem 1.5rem;">
    <div class="container has-text-centered">
      <h3 class="title is-2 has-text-white">Ready to spend your time building?</h3>
      <p class="subtitle has-text-white mt-3">Join the Columbia Outdoor contractor network. Licensed contractors in Washington, Oregon, and Idaho welcome.</p>
      <a href="/contractor/register" class="button is-warning is-large is-rounded mt-4">
        <strong>Apply Now — It's Free</strong>
      </a>
      <p class="mt-4">
        <a href="/contact" class="has-text-white-ter is-size-7">Have questions? Contact us.</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  {{template "footer.gohtml" .}}
{{end}}
